{
  "title": "Brand3 Information Acquisition And Evidence Mixing Flow Audit",
  "status": "audit_only",
  "core_question": "What does Brand3 actually collect, how does it classify or lose context, and what does it create from that information before the LLM writes findings?",
  "answer": "Brand3 collects broad raw signals, then flattens them into dimension-level evidence without enough eligibility metadata before report narrative generation.",
